---
name: "Team"
title: "Our team | Lightening Lives"
description: "The scientists, laboratory specialists and operations staff of Lightening Lives, with its patron and advisory board."
label: Team
h1: The people behind the tests
lead: "A small team of scientists, laboratory specialists and operations staff, led by the company's founders and guided by a patron and an advisory board."
closing:
  h2: Work with us
  body: Most of our work begins as a collaboration with an institution.
  solid: { text: Partner with us, href: /partnerships/ }
  line: { text: Contact us, href: /contact/ }
---
{#- Team (content file 5.13). The layout opens the page and closes it with 5.13's band. Every entry is
    src/site/_data/team.json through person() (src/site/_includes/person.njk), its id the person's
    slug (3.2), its portrait's alt the person's name. The founders lead the page with their joint
    portrait, names, credentials and roles; their bios are on About, linked. The patron's and the advisers' blurbs
    are placeholders until each approves one, so they show name, role (the patron's) and portrait
    only; the patron and the advisory board share a band, side by side, so that one entry is not a
    band of its own. The [TBC] note on Jyothi Vislavath's honorific (Part 8 item 20) does not render;
    the name stays as team.json has it. Portraits are shown with consent pending Part 8 item 22. -#}
{%- set arrow = '<svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="12" viewBox="0 0 18 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M1 6h15M11 1l5 5-5 5"/></svg>' %}
{%- from "person.njk" import person with context %}
{%- from "picture.njk" import picture with context %}

  <!-- Founders: names and roles; their portrait and bios are on About -->
  <section id="founders" class="section" aria-labelledby="founders-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="founders-h" class="h2">Founders</h2>
      <div class="founders mt-10">
        <div class="founders-photo">
          {{ picture("person-founders", "Dr. Giriraj Ratan Chandak and Mrs. Nidhi Chandak", "(min-width: 40rem) 20rem, 90vw") }}
        </div>
        <ul class="people people-one">
          {%- for p in team.founders %}
          {{ person(p) }}
          {%- endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <a class="link mt-8" href="/about/#founders">Read about the founders
        {{ arrow | safe }}
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Team: six entries, each with a portrait, a role and a bio -->
  <section id="team" class="section bg-paper" aria-labelledby="team-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="team-h" class="h2">Team</h2>
      <ul class="people people-team mt-10">
        {%- for p in team.team %}
        {{ person(p, { photo: true, bio: true }) }}
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Patron and advisory board: side by side -->
  <section id="patron-and-advisers" class="section" aria-labelledby="patron-h advisers-h">
    <div class="wrap people-groups">
      <div id="patron">
        <h2 id="patron-h" class="h2">Patron</h2>
        <ul class="people people-figures mt-10">
          {%- for p in team.patron %}
          {{ person(p, { photo: true }) }}
          {%- endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div id="advisory-board">
        <h2 id="advisers-h" class="h2">Advisory board</h2>
        <ul class="people people-figures people-two mt-10">
          {%- for p in team.advisers %}
          {{ person(p, { photo: true }) }}
          {%- endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
